									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deltathree" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6974566); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6974566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609209651" alt="DeltaThree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6974566)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deltathree" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6974566); return false;" >DeltaThree</a></span> <span class="odate time_1609207017 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">29 Dec 2020 01:56</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13962471/seeking-greenlight-the-first-and-forever-prisoner">(Seeking Greenlight) The First and Forever Prisoner</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4856159">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> History</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Following the history of the one we know as SCP-682 from it's birth as a child of the Scarlet King, exiled to Earth until she could kill everyone, to being an inmate in Titania's Prison, to trying to release it's father only to be imprisoned by the Keepers. The only thing stopping it from detroying the world has been the legacy of the Jailors that have kept it imprisoned for most of it's existence, the Foundation is only the most recent to inherit the role.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Connecting the dots between several hints regarding 682<br />
- born as <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dust-and-blood">A'zieb, the fourth child/bride of the Scarlet King</a><br />
- Mal-Va-Gar-Ta-Mor, <a href="/scp-2932">SCP-2932</a>-A, first imprisonment under the Children of the Night and the Hudaru<br />
- The Bastard Son of Apep, <a href="/scp-557">SCP-557</a>-1, the Ancient Containment Site was actually the first version of <a href="/scp-2317">SCP-2317</a>, the stone in the floor of Room 501 sealing off the Scarlet King(the other door was made later when this way could not be accessed) his fourth child led an army to break his seal only to be imprisoned as well.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> This isn't about killing the Hard-to-Kill Reptile, this is about why it matters that it is contained by the Foundation and it's precursors. Also information on why both the Reptile and the King are not meant to be destroyed at all.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I am also planning on connecting Mekhane/Wan and/or the Lord of Endowments in this story to tie it to another tale I'm working on. The Gods are critical in sealing and containing the Prisoners.</p>

							</div>

								
					
