			<div class="content" id="post-content-4856105">
									

<p>1) Don't post a sandbox unless it has been specifically requested.</p>
<p>2) There's not much of a narrative here. You've got essentially a neat quirk that resolves some interesting questions, but it would be interesting to find out how they discovered the problem and how they determined that the objects were from that date. `Also, how it was determined that they from &quot;unset coordinates&quot; would be really interesting.</p>
<p>3) Another problem is that the items are appearing based on time coordinate problems, not geographic coordinates. While it's cool, it should be better stated.</p>
<p>4) You need an actual hook, not just more description. The question is why is this interesting, and how does it contribute to the universe needs to be addressed, and this is the section for that.</p>
<p>Cool idea; just needs some polishing.</p>

